  <Sequence sap2010:Annotation.AnnotationText="- Overview&#xA;Create search string to be stored in Option Data Table.&#xA;&#xA;- Input/Output&#xA;in_Equation as value set on Equation &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_From as value set on From &lt;String&gt; &#xA;in_To as value set on To &lt;String&gt; &#xA;in_ConvertType as converted Type &lt;String&gt;&#xA;in_FiledName as FiledName  &lt;String&gt;&#xA;io_dt_OptionData as Optional info table to be created &lt;DataTable&gt;" DisplayName="MakeOptionDataTable" sap2010:WorkflowViewState.IdRef="Sequence_7">
